01:44:46,730 --> 01:44:48,730
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ito. Dahil to my

1623
01:44:48,730 --> 01:44:50,730
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: understanding, kung may

1624
01:44:50,730 --> 01:44:52,730
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: papasukin pong international agreement

1625
01:44:52,730 --> 01:44:54,730
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung DFA at

1626
01:44:54,730 --> 01:44:56,730
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the very least, para i-ensure yung

1627
01:44:56,730 --> 01:44:58,730
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: consistency of language, consistency ng

1628
01:44:58,730 --> 01:45:00,000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mga agreements natin before.

1629
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:11,620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Or dapat po may review or even may comment doon po sa ano yung papasukin kung mayroon mang incompatibilities, inconsistencies na kailangan pong ayusin.

1630
01:45:12,040 --> 01:45:15,960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So for now, at least mas enlightened ako, but siguro last na lang po.

1631
01:45:15,960 --> 01:45:24,580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So for now, Mr. Chair, ang clear po is the DFA cannot provide a copy of this MOU to the committee.

1632
01:45:25,500 --> 01:45:28,960
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: No, we cannot, Your Honor. It is not with us, perhaps.

1633
01:45:28,960 --> 01:45:32,020
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: But we can request the concerned agency.

1634
01:45:33,560 --> 01:45:34,000
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Thank you.

1635
01:45:34,020 --> 01:45:38,120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Much appreciated. That would be helpful, Mr. Chair, kung maaari bago po mag-plenary.

1636
01:45:38,320 --> 01:45:39,260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

1637
01:45:39,560 --> 01:45:42,420
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Thank you, Congressman Rene. And thank you, Madam Secretary.

1638
01:45:43,220 --> 01:45:48,160
