1642
01:46:08,690 --> 01:46:11,390
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Yung sa amin po, palengke naman pinagawa namin.

1643
01:46:12,390 --> 01:46:14,870
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At LGU funded lang po.

1644
01:46:15,930 --> 01:46:18,450
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: 31,000 square meters.

1645
01:46:18,450 --> 01:46:28,270
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Because we believe na may partnership po dapat sa gobyerno with the government.

1646
01:46:29,210 --> 01:46:29,450
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So...

1647
01:46:31,810 --> 01:46:34,030
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Merong paglalagyan po.

1648
01:46:35,270 --> 01:46:36,530
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Merong pangangailangan.

1649
01:46:36,790 --> 01:46:41,170
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Dahil kasi lahat nung buong Region 1,

1650
01:46:42,370 --> 01:46:46,290
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: isang linggo na hong dumadaan sa Cabanatuan City.

1651
01:46:47,650 --> 01:46:48,530
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Buong Region 1.

1652
01:46:50,680 --> 01:46:52,540
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Pati na yung Region 3.

1653
01:46:53,520 --> 01:46:55,100
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Pati na yung Region 2.

1654
01:46:56,140 --> 01:46:58,520
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, I cannot emphasize further.

1655
01:46:58,520 --> 01:47:02,520
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kasi kasama ko ang buong probinsya.

1656
01:47:03,180 --> 01:47:12,580
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ng Aurora at parte ng Quezon ay nandun din po sa amin sa Vizcaya.

1657
01:47:13,240 --> 01:47:28,300
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Doon po mas kaya strategically located yung pag tinanong po niyo sa Northeastern Luzon ang isang consular office.

1658
01:47:28,720 --> 01:47:29,240
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So...

1659
01:47:30,200 --> 01:47:32,380
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Yun po lamang ang aking gustong sabihin.

1660
01:47:33,180 --> 01:47:42,800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: at gusto ko pong tanong lang yung kalagayan na hindi na po kailangan sagutin.

1661
01:47:43,180 --> 01:47:47,940
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang akin lang, sulat lang po para maintindihan ko lamang po yung kalagayan

1662
01:47:47,940 --> 01:47:54,500
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ng mga nag-request na kasamahan kong mga kongresista ng Consular Office.

1663
01:47:55,400 --> 01:47:57,720
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Yun lamang po ang first question.

1664
01:47:59,320 --> 01:48:00,960
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Kung pwede ko pong sagutin.

1665
01:48:00,960 --> 01:48:02,100
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Salamat, Your Honor.

1666
01:48:02,600 --> 01:48:08,200
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Naalala ko po yung pag-uusap natin last year tungkol dito sa inyong request.

1667
01:48:09,200 --> 01:48:12,240
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Palagi ko pong pinapaalahanan yung aming Consular Office

1668
01:48:12,240 --> 01:48:18,400
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: kasi alam kong malaki yung populasyon and coming from the different regions.

1669
01:48:18,820 --> 01:48:22,140
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, based on the information na naman natanggap po namin,

1670
01:48:22,540 --> 01:48:28,040
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: nandun din po kayo sa listahan na yun na sa kagaya ng sinabi ko

1671
01:48:28,040 --> 01:48:30,700
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: is kailangan po din na-approval.

1672
01:48:30,960 --> 01:48:32,720
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: ng Department of Budget and Management.

1673
01:48:33,420 --> 01:48:39,300
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So, naghihintay lang po kami ng approval ng DBM on this matter.

1674
01:48:39,400 --> 01:48:44,220
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: But we're very, very conscious kasi ilang beses na po tayo nag-uusap tungkol dito.

1675
01:48:44,680 --> 01:48:45,080
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Salamat po.

1676
01:48:45,860 --> 01:48:48,640
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Madam, salamat po, Madam Secretary.

1677
01:48:49,300 --> 01:48:51,400
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang pangalawang question po.

1678
01:48:52,260 --> 01:48:55,600
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Sa kasaysayan po ay inapi ang balsang China

1679
01:48:55,600 --> 01:48:58,260
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ng mga foreign powers.

1680
01:48:58,260 --> 01:49:00,900
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Kaya sinasabi kong madalas,

1681
01:49:00,960 --> 01:49:06,100
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: huwag silang maging katulad ng Bansang Hapon

1682
01:49:06,100 --> 01:49:11,300
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: na nung sila'y apahin nung pagyayari ng gera sibil ng Amerika

1683
01:49:11,300 --> 01:49:18,160
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: at nung mag-progress na ang Bansang Hapon at kinonsiderang world power

1684
01:49:18,160 --> 01:49:23,660
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: e nung 1905 sa gera ng Strait of Tsushima

1685
01:49:23,660 --> 01:49:28,740
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: wherein the Japanese Navy beat the Russian fleet

1686
01:49:28,740 --> 01:49:30,660
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: and the Russian fleet,

1687
01:49:30,960 --> 01:49:35,960
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: and the Russians went to President Theodore Roosevelt

1688
01:49:35,960 --> 01:49:39,140
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: to ask for help para magkaayos sila.

1689
01:49:39,920 --> 01:49:42,000
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Tayo po ang madlang Pilipino.

1690
01:49:42,640 --> 01:49:49,620
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ang masang Pilipino po ay nakiki[unclear]. Ang damdamin po nila ay nag-uumigting.

1691
01:49:49,920 --> 01:49:54,980
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ano po ang ginagawa natin doon sa pangapi na ginagawa ng China sa atin ngayon?

1692
01:49:56,960 --> 01:50:02,120
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Tungkol doon po sa marami pong aspekto yung tanong nyo.

1693
01:50:02,340 --> 01:50:07,560
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Siguro po sa umpisa pa lang is kung pinag-uusapan natin ang karagatan,

1694
01:50:08,240 --> 01:50:09,940
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: the West Philippine Sea,

1695
01:50:10,220 --> 01:50:15,540
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: well, nakikita rin po ninyo na ang ating mga security and defense establishments

1696
01:50:15,540 --> 01:50:16,440
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: kung anong ginagawa.

1697
01:50:16,960 --> 01:50:19,760
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: However, as far as Department of Foreign Affairs concerned,

1698
01:50:20,660 --> 01:50:27,400
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: ang mandato po ng Pangulo ay yung discussion should be done

1699
01:50:27,400 --> 01:50:31,640
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: with diplomacy and diplomatic dialogue.

1700
01:50:32,340 --> 01:50:38,940
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So kami po ay may dalawang mekanismo na ginagamit namin sa aming pakikipag-usap sa China

1701
01:50:38,940 --> 01:50:43,200
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: and that is the bilateral consultation mechanism on the South China Sea

1702
01:50:43,200 --> 01:50:45,460
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: at saka foreign ministry consultations.

1703
01:50:46,060 --> 01:50:51,100
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Nandito po nakasaloob lahat ang mga issues na pinag-uusapan.

1704
01:50:51,260 --> 01:50:54,920
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Ito po ay twice at least a year ginagawa.

1705
01:50:55,420 --> 01:50:59,840
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: At meron po kami ding mga ibang mekanismo kagaya ng sa ASEAN

1706
01:50:59,840 --> 01:51:01,560
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: at hopefully,

1707
01:51:02,340 --> 01:51:09,740
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: mak-conclude namin yung ASEAN-China Code of Conduct on the South China Sea.

1708
01:51:09,740 --> 01:51:16,540
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So ito po yung aming pamamaraan na tinitingnan din po namin.

1709
01:51:16,980 --> 01:51:23,300
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Nandun din po yung mga nahuhuli nilang mga Pilipino na sinasabing sa China po.

1710
01:51:23,440 --> 01:51:29,200
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So tinitingnan po namin ang kanilang kalagayan through our consular offices.

1711
01:51:29,680 --> 01:51:31,820
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Isang tingin namin dito, these are consular issues.

1712
01:51:32,340 --> 01:51:37,500
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: At sa Vienna Convention, dapat sinasabi nila sa amin kung ano-ano bang kaso nila.

1713
01:51:38,140 --> 01:51:40,100
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: So nakatutok po kami dyan.

1714
01:51:41,600 --> 01:51:47,800
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Well, ito po yung aming sinasagawa as Department of Foreign Affairs.

1715
01:51:48,820 --> 01:51:54,440
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Bilang isa sa principal author ng modernisasyon ng Coast Guard,

1716
01:51:55,340 --> 01:52:00,140
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: talaga pong nakakalungkot lamang po kaya ako lamang binanggit.

1717
01:52:00,140 --> 01:52:02,140
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At alam ko pong diplomasyon.

1718
01:52:02,340 --> 01:52:04,840
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ito po siya ang ating tatahaking landas.

1719
01:52:06,040 --> 01:52:08,340
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Nasa inyo po, Madam Secretary, ang aking suporta.

1720
01:52:09,640 --> 01:52:13,800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: At natutuwa po ako sa Foreign Affairs family.

1721
01:52:14,500 --> 01:52:16,280
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: And magandang hapon po sa inyo.

1722
01:52:17,140 --> 01:52:17,820
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Salamat po.

1723
01:52:20,570 --> 01:52:22,390
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Thank you, Representative Vergara.

1724
01:52:25,110 --> 01:52:28,610
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: Before we proceed to the next interpellator,

1725
01:52:29,210 --> 01:52:32,830
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: may we recognize the presence of the Honorable Sara Elago.

1726
01:52:34,390 --> 01:52:40,190
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: We proceed with the member from the minority, Representative Antonio Tinio.

1727
01:52:40,250 --> 01:52:41,270
Rep. Sancho Fernando "Ando" F. Oaminal: You are now recognized, sir.

1728
01:52:44,620 --> 01:52:45,680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Chair.

1729
01:52:48,980 --> 01:52:58,170
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Chair, una, kaugnay sa proposed budget ng DFA,

1730
01:52:59,050 --> 01:53:06,670
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I noted one item, ICT expenditures for 2027, 956.61 million.

1731
01:53:08,510 --> 01:53:11,010
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Napasin ko po as a trend na,

1732
01:53:11,590 --> 01:53:18,750
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in recent years, lumulobo, lumalaki yung mga ICT expenditures ng maraming agencies, hindi lang kayo.

1733
01:53:19,370 --> 01:53:21,990
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, para saan po ito?

1734
01:53:22,450 --> 01:53:27,850
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At how much was the budget, is the ICT budget for this year?

1735
01:53:29,050 --> 01:53:31,710
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kumusta ang utilization? Saan ito ginamit?

1736
01:53:31,870 --> 01:53:35,770
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And why 956 million for next year?

1737
01:53:38,990 --> 01:53:40,130
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: Thank you, Your Honor.

1738
01:53:40,250 --> 01:53:43,310
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: I will refer the question now to two points.

1739
01:53:44,050 --> 01:53:49,430
DFA Secretary Ma. Theresa P. Lazaro: First is our Assistant Secretary in charge of ICT and all these issues, please.

1740
01:53:54,110 --> 01:53:55,270
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Thank you, Madam Secretary.

1741
01:53:55,650 --> 01:53:57,750
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Thank you, Honorable Tinio.

1742
01:53:57,750 --> 01:54:03,970
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Sir, for our ICT expenditures for 2025 to 2026,

1743
01:54:04,370 --> 01:54:07,050
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: all these expenditures were approved by the MITI.

1744
01:54:07,950 --> 01:54:13,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: It's a committee composed of the DICT, DBM, and all other agencies.

1745
01:54:14,590 --> 01:54:16,750
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: The overall surge in the MOE,

1746
01:54:17,890 --> 01:54:29,470
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: the MOE budget at 115% and our capital outlay budget at 400% in our ISSP from 2025 to 2026,

1747
01:54:29,470 --> 01:54:36,710
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: marks a deliberate fiscal pivot away from acquiring day-to-day operational ICT assets

1748
01:54:36,710 --> 01:54:44,050
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: to strategically acquiring large-scale, enterprise-grade, and high-value capital ICT assets

1749
01:54:44,050 --> 01:54:46,590
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: to support the institutional

1750
01:54:46,590 --> 01:54:47,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: reinforcement of the

1751
01:54:47,650 --> 01:54:52,950
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: President's policy directives and digitization assets of the department, sir,

1752
01:54:53,030 --> 01:54:56,630
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: for both critical, mission-critical, and frontline services.

1753
01:54:57,310 --> 01:55:00,390
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Essentially, sir, we have four priorities for the ICT.

1754
01:55:00,630 --> 01:55:01,490
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: First is cybersecurity.

1755
01:55:02,490 --> 01:55:04,890
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Second is data privacy and data protection.

1756
01:55:05,570 --> 01:55:07,370
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Third would be digital transformation.

1757
01:55:08,170 --> 01:55:13,710
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: And the last one, sir, would be the information systems strategic plan and ICT procurement.

1758
01:55:13,710 --> 01:55:17,590
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: For 2026 to 2028, sir, as I've mentioned earlier,

1759
01:55:17,650 --> 01:55:22,950
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: our ISSP plan was approved last year in May 2025.

1760
01:55:23,530 --> 01:55:26,850
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: We're currently utilizing ICT for four.

1761
01:55:27,310 --> 01:55:29,810
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: First is for the foreign policy services.

1762
01:55:30,530 --> 01:55:33,430
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: These are cloud-based office productivity tools,

1763
01:55:33,890 --> 01:55:36,130
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: security for our ICT infrastructure,

1764
01:55:36,870 --> 01:55:39,190
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: technical support to the home office.

1765
01:55:39,710 --> 01:55:42,770
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: Second, sir, would be for diplomatic and consular services,

1766
01:55:43,490 --> 01:55:45,470
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: the ATN management database,

1767
01:55:45,470 --> 01:55:46,890
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: the e-passport,

1768
01:55:46,990 --> 01:55:47,470
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: and the passport system.

1769
01:55:47,650 --> 01:55:49,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: We also have the e-passport appointment system,

1770
01:55:49,650 --> 01:55:51,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: e-apostile, e-visa,

1771
01:55:51,650 --> 01:55:53,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: fraud management and detection tools.

1772
01:55:53,650 --> 01:55:55,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: We also have a call center,

1773
01:55:55,650 --> 01:55:57,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: the technical support to our foreign service post,

1774
01:55:57,650 --> 01:55:59,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: and to our consular offices.

1775
01:55:59,650 --> 01:56:03,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: The last one, sir, would be for general administration and support services.

1776
01:56:03,650 --> 01:56:05,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: We have our ICT infrastructure.

1777
01:56:05,650 --> 01:56:07,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: For our personnel, sir,

1778
01:56:07,650 --> 01:56:09,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: we have the human resources,

1779
01:56:09,650 --> 01:56:11,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: HCMPS, that's how we call it.

1780
01:56:11,650 --> 01:56:13,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: For the finance side,

1781
01:56:13,650 --> 01:56:15,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: we have the ENGAS.

1782
01:56:15,650 --> 01:56:17,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: We also have web presence,

1783
01:56:17,650 --> 01:56:19,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: we have the sense care of the DICT, sir.

1784
01:56:19,650 --> 01:56:21,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: We have collaboration software,

1785
01:56:21,650 --> 01:56:23,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: and we also have our visitor management.

1786
01:56:23,650 --> 01:56:25,650
DFA Assistant Secretary Charmaine A. Serna-Chua: For our challenges,

